e xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3b\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-41\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3d\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_9\"><g style=\"fill: #2d3748\" transform=\"translate(299.243636 15.4) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3d\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-41\" transform=\"translate(60 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#IBMPlexSans-Regular-3d\" transform=\"translate(120 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"pbb41e670cc\"><rect x=\"46.1\" y=\"11.792\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"121.968\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · Three-year profit per learner or seat ($)","note":null},"answer":"<p>Employer seat: year 1 $135; year 2: 70% renew × ($250 − $40 − $10) = $140; year 3: 49% × $200 = $98. Total <b>$373</b>.</p> <p>Individual: $140 + 10% buy again × ($400 − $40 − $30) = <b>$173</b>.</p> <p><b>So-what:</b> over three years an employer seat earns 2.2× as much, because renewals don't need new marketing.</p>"},{"q":"What would it take to make the employer route work?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<ul><li><b>A small sales team</b> targeting HR and learning heads at mid-sized firms</li><li><b>Employer features:</b> progress reports, cohort scheduling, invoicing</li> <li><b>Proof of results:</b> completion rates and skills tests, since employers buy outcomes</li><li>Check the 70% renewal assumption with a pilot of 10 employers</li></ul>"}],"reco":"Build the employer route. A seat earns about the same as an individual learner in year 1 ($135 vs $140), but because employers renew, a seat earns about $373 over three years against $173 for an individual, 2.2× as much. Start with a small sales team and the reporting features employers need, while keeping the individual business. Risk: the 70% renewal rate is borrowed from other providers. Next step: pilot with 10 employers and measure completion and renewal intent.","great":["Compares profit after the cost to win, not price","Looks beyond year 1 to renewals","Quantifies the three-year difference","Lists what the new channel needs to work"],"id":61,"slug":"vivid-career-courses"}